            "review_title": "Review at Ö by Hoang Tung",
            "review_text": "Duy P\n4 contributions\n0\nmore than a restaurant\nAug 2026 • Couples\nThis was my second visit to the restaurant. I had previously visited Å by TUNG, which also offered a tasting menu concept. This time, I was particularly impressed by the new space and décor. Ö by HOANG TUNG has clearly invested a great deal in elevating its service.\n\nAs for the food, it is still a 16-course menu, which felt a little too much for me. However, the overall experience, from the food to the space, truly surprised me.\n\nIt’s not just about the food. Every aspect of the service was thoughtfully done and had its own story. I really enjoyed the way the experience allowed me to discover Vietnamese culture and the meaningful stories behind it.\n\nThank you to Chef Hoang Tung and the entire team. I sincerely hope that when I return to Vietnam next time, I’ll have the chance to come back and look forward to discovering even more wonderful experiences.\n\nWishing Ö by HOANG TUNG continued success!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 27, 2026",
